OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FA rather cloudy day with a
OL,6,Fscattering of light showers
OL,7,Fdeveloping. However the odd brighter
OL,8,Fspell may break through during the
OL,9,Fafternoon. Winds light from the west
OL,10,Fto northwest.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTonight:FCloudy skies and scattered
OL,13,Fshowers from a line Inverness to
OL,14,FUllapool northwards. Elsewhere mainly
OL,15,Fdry with some clear spells, appearing
OL,16,Fmost readily towards the southern end
OL,17,Fof the Great Glen.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
