OL,3,GHighlands & Eilean Siar
OL,4,
OL,5,CTuesday:FInverness Eastern Ross,
OL,6,FCaithness and easter Sutherland
OL,7,Fkeeping cloudy skies with some
OL,8,Fscattered drizzly showers. Elsewhere
OL,9,Fdry with bright and sunny spells best
OL,10,Fin west. Winds light.
OL,11,
OL,12,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,13,FNortheast cloudy with patchy light
OL,14,Frain and drizzle. Elsewhere dry with
OL,15,Fbrighter spells. Winds light. Early
OL,16,Ffrost and possibily fog patches in
OL,17,Fwest.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
